{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:40 2026-10-07 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:40 2026-10-07 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:40 2026-10-07 HKT</p><p>觀塘翠屏北邨翠桃樓一樓上單位，今日（10月7日）晚上近8時起火，更有一名13歲男住戶逃至窗外，站在冷氣機頂求援。晚上片段所見當時單位黑煙滾滾冒出，少年僅穿底褲逃至窗外，狀甚驚險。</p><img alt=\"事發單位冒黑煙。Threads：ckm_nancy\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34cc24fd40b5c12e94747c225d9d14c4/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-07-20h59m32s607.png\"/><img alt=\"少年站在冷氣頂待救。Threads：ckm_nancy\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/74153a0822ab0b4d646428b381024fe4/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-07-20h59m40s107.png\"/><img alt=\"少年站在冷氣頂待救。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6697a184f84a36a3855efba4f9abd324/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_21_01_25_0.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"少年站在冷氣頂待救。讀者提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5335a96bc8dcf05110c9c5e7f0d37f84/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_21_01_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防升起雲梯救援。FB：鄭俊昇\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00e86d080638df0c2d50a555251c4683/2026-10/838951208_2130266781215597_5579388610677987018_n.jpg\"/><p>多人目睹報案求助，消防接報趕至，出動一喉一煙帽隊，並升起雲梯救援。最終少年順利返回安全位置，清醒獲送聯合醫院檢查，目前火警原因仍待調查。</p><img alt=\"現場為觀塘翠屏北邨翠桃樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e41a2cdc3c6d7fae6fdb5b72e82b6165/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_21_00_56_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為觀塘翠屏北邨翠桃樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c9f859f73fe74fe9760f38bac1a84451/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_21_00_56.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場灌救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/299a751ff992f3c9803578f2396dceef/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_21_00_54.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火單位被熏黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e621ed270a320c9853836b648c9dc09/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_21_00_57.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火單位被熏黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b748ab9bb7cfbe8de2362c6b9b8e0e01/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_21_00_56_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T14:20:05.196845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}